'''Crazy Hearts''' (進撃の狂乱ネコ, ''Shingeki no Kyōran Neko'', '''Attack of the Crazed Cats''') is a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (L): Wallet starts with 1000¢.

